PRIVACY

Eyrest takes nothing from you. It has no user accounts, no telemetry, no
analytics, and makes no network connections. Your settings and usage data never
leave your device -- they are stored only in a local file on your own computer.
The copyright holder neither collects nor receives any personal data from users.

